# Mechanics stability

Before changing files or functions tagged with `@mechanic` (or combat/movement/physics under `shared/`, `src/game/net/`):

1. Read the matching section in [`MECHANICS.md`](mdc:MECHANICS.md).
2. Confirm dependencies; note any new trade-offs in `MECHANICS.md` if behavior changes.
3. Keep shared sim math identical on client and server (prediction).
4. Run / update related tests (`npm test`). Do not silently break listed test cases.
5. Do not migrate to Matter/Box2D without an explicit netcode redesign discussion.
